The numbered patch stack in patches/ is applied to the DeSmuME source tree by
build.sh and modifies DeSmuME's own files. It covers the headless CLI, GDB-stub
control for screenshots, input, touch, savestates and disassembly, transport
hardening, shared scheduler state, and exact VBlank frame stepping. It is
therefore a derivative work of DeSmuME (GPL-2.0-or-later) and is licensed
GPL-2.0-or-later. The adapter README is the current patch inventory. See
../../NOTICE.

